  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/fb057e1e-0f9c-4bf0-a5f2-ae469a74da80-f876c517-f434-4731-a40e-b5af5f976f7a-image.png\" style=\"width: 328px; height: 230px;\" />​​​​​​​</p><p>Given, Area of the triangle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∆</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&rArr;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&rArr;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>56</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&rArr;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>&minus;</mo><mn>46</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&rArr;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> and <math><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> (Not possible)<br /><br />Altitude from &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo mathvariant=\"bold\">:</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br />Altitude from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo mathvariant=\"bold\">:</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />So, their point of intersection is <math><mi>H</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
